# Update the Fynda Idea data plan after every catalog write

Canvas: `~/.cursor/projects/Users-nikeshhvijayabaskaran-Desktop-Projects-Fynda-Fynda-Idea-fynda-idea/canvases/idea-data-plan.canvas.tsx`

After **any** Fynda Idea catalog change (via MCP, admin REST, or SQL) — ideas, categories, or collections — update the canvas **in the same turn**:

- Add, remove, or edit the matching rows.
- Bump the `updated` date.
- Keep headline stats computed from array lengths, never hard-coded.

A catalog pass is not done until the data plan matches Fynda Idea. Also log the pass in Mina `mina_aiagent/MEMORY.md`.
